WEBVTT

01:30.500 --> 01:32.500
We'll compete in literature then

01:32.500 --> 01:36.300
And your buddies and my men,
in martial arts and wits. How's that?

01:39.500 --> 01:42.100
Now, don't you get us involved

01:42.100 --> 01:44.100
You think you're his match?

01:44.500 --> 01:48.100
Don't worry, just leave it all to me,
all right?

01:51.500 --> 01:53.100
You're on

01:53.100 --> 01:54.500
Deal

01:56.500 --> 02:02.500
If you lose, you'll be sent into exile,
never to return to Ping'an Town

02:06.500 --> 02:08.500
Want to think it over?

02:08.500 --> 02:10.500
No need...

02:10.500 --> 02:11.500
Deal!

02:32.200 --> 02:33.200
Farewell!

02:39.400 --> 02:41.400
Still thinking about the Princess?

02:41.400 --> 02:45.400
If we lose the duel,
we'll be sent into exile!

02:45.400 --> 02:46.400
Precisely!

02:46.400 --> 02:53.000
Let me ask you. Who is my match
in literature in Ping'an Town?

02:54.400 --> 02:57.400
I'll win the first round for sure!

02:58.400 --> 03:03.400
What about the other two rounds?
We'll lose for sure!

03:03.400 --> 03:08.000
Yeah, I'm just as worried as Shou.
I'm really worried, you know

03:08.400 --> 03:14.400
You'll be the death of me. Isn't the
No 1 Swallow resting at your place?

03:16.400 --> 03:21.400
With Spicy woman around,
we'll win in martial arts too

03:21.400 --> 03:24.400
If we win two rounds,
we'll win the duel

03:24.400 --> 03:27.200
What are we waiting for then?
Let's go!

03:43.400 --> 03:46.000
Miss Ma...

03:47.400 --> 03:50.400
They came to see how you are

03:51.400 --> 03:53.400
We're here to visit you

03:53.400 --> 03:58.000
-What happened to you?
-I had a fall, that's all

03:58.400 --> 04:01.400
How is Her Highness?
Why does she want to see me?

04:02.000 --> 04:08.000
Her guards were missing, so she panicked
and sent the lark to look for you

04:08.000 --> 04:14.400
After she moved to the Marquis' abode,
she forgot all about it

04:15.000 --> 04:16.400
I see

04:21.000 --> 04:24.000
You have something to say to me?

04:26.400 --> 04:32.000
Well, you see, we just challenged
the Marquis to a duel

04:33.000 --> 04:38.000
The consequences are grave.
That's why we hope you'll help us

04:38.000 --> 04:43.400
You went to see Her Highness. How did
you end up challenging the Marquis?

04:43.400 --> 04:45.400
Her Highness rejected his proposal

04:45.400 --> 04:49.400
So he's trying to win her hand
through the duel

04:49.400 --> 04:54.400
They grew up together and are close.
Why would he force her to marry him?

04:54.400 --> 05:00.000
Who would dare press Her Highness
anyway? Could you have made a mistake?

05:03.400 --> 05:05.400
Why did you hit me?

05:05.400 --> 05:09.400
The Marquis is trying to prove himself
to Her Highness through the duel

05:09.400 --> 05:12.400
Isn't he out to press her
to marry him?

05:13.400 --> 05:17.400
Precisely.
The Marquis is too much

05:17.400 --> 05:23.400
Seeing Her Highness was all alone,
we had to stand up for her

05:26.400 --> 05:29.200
You'll help us, won't you?

05:29.400 --> 05:33.400
From what I can see, Her Highness
was just pulling the Marquis' leg

05:33.400 --> 05:36.400
But you were eager to please her

05:36.400 --> 05:41.000
Instead of doing what you should, you're
poking your noses into others' affairs!

05:41.000 --> 05:45.000
She's in a predicament.
How can we not lend a helping hand?

05:45.400 --> 05:48.000
Where's your sense of chivalry?

05:48.400 --> 05:53.400
Her Highness said the Marquis tried to
make her marry him. How can it be fake?

05:53.400 --> 05:59.200
Exactly. She's a friend of ours.
We can't sit back and do nothing

05:59.200 --> 06:02.200
You're just doing it
for your precious princess

06:02.400 --> 06:05.400
Aren't you her bodyguard too?

06:05.400 --> 06:07.400
My duty is to protect her

06:07.400 --> 06:11.400
What does her marriage concern me?
And what does it concern you?

06:11.400 --> 06:18.400
I've got it. You're jealous of
Her Highness' beauty and talent

06:18.400 --> 06:21.000
That's why you won't help her

06:21.400 --> 06:24.400
No doubt about it

06:25.400 --> 06:28.400
This trick isn't going to work on me

06:28.400 --> 06:33.400
You shouldn't have overestimated
yourselves and taken up the challenge

06:33.400 --> 06:36.400
Since you're so noble,
take Ouyang Xiaotian on yourselves

06:36.400 --> 06:40.400
I'm not in good form and need to
recuperate anyway. Now get out!

06:40.400 --> 06:43.000
Excuse me, this is my room

06:45.400 --> 06:47.400
You won't help us? Fine

06:48.400 --> 06:52.400
I don't believe we'll lose for sure
without her help. Agreed?

06:52.400 --> 06:54.400
-You think so?
-Yup

06:56.200 --> 06:58.200
What's happening?

06:58.400 --> 07:04.400
Wu Fuqi, Wei Delu and Mei Shouquan
are challenging the Marquis to a duel

07:04.400 --> 07:06.400
Surely not?

07:06.400 --> 07:09.400
They're overestimating themselves

07:11.400 --> 07:15.400
They're not. My son is bright.
It's only a duel anyway

07:16.400 --> 07:19.400
We won't know who wins
until after the duel

07:19.400 --> 07:23.400
Besides, it's an honour
to take the Marquis on

07:23.400 --> 07:26.400
Even if my son loses,
he'll be held in respect

07:29.400 --> 07:34.400
Look carefully at the notice,
Auntie!

07:35.400 --> 07:39.400
"Losers and their families
will be sent into exile,"

07:39.400 --> 07:41.400
"never to return to Ping'an Town!"

07:43.400 --> 07:46.400
-So they'll have to leave our town?
-What if they won't?

07:46.400 --> 07:49.400
With them gone, we'll have peace!

07:49.400 --> 07:53.400
We ought to thank the Marquis for
getting rid of the three vermins for us!

07:56.400 --> 08:01.400
I'm really worried about Shou. He's
the only male descendant in our family

08:01.400 --> 08:04.400
You must watch over him

08:06.400 --> 08:11.400
Come on, Mother, I'll be all right

08:11.400 --> 08:15.000
Give Father a break

08:16.400 --> 08:21.400
How can I not worry?
How will you get out of this mess?

08:21.400 --> 08:25.000
If you lose,
we'll have to be sent into exile

08:25.400 --> 08:29.400
That's all right. But will you
be able to take the hardship?

08:29.400 --> 08:33.400
Life isn't so comfortable
in the barbarous and remote lands

08:33.400 --> 08:39.400
There's no bird's nest or shark's fin.
What will I feed you with, my precious?

08:39.400 --> 08:43.400
I'm a big man, Mother.
I don't just know how to eat

08:43.400 --> 08:46.400
I might win the duel.
I may not lose!

08:47.400 --> 08:52.400
Even if you win, you'll become
a thorn in the Marquis' flesh

08:52.400 --> 08:55.400
Will he leave you alone?

08:56.000 --> 09:02.400
You'll never be safe.
Have you thought of the consequences?

09:04.400 --> 09:08.000
Never mind about him.
Just eat your fill

09:08.000 --> 09:13.000
If he loses the duel, we won't
get to eat all this food anymore

09:13.400 --> 09:16.400
Why not run away while we still can?

09:16.400 --> 09:19.400
Where can we run away to?

09:19.400 --> 09:23.400
All the six provinces and 18 counties
are under Ouyang Xiaotian's charge

09:24.400 --> 09:27.400
If we're caught,
the punishment will double

09:27.400 --> 09:31.400
He might even put us to death

09:32.400 --> 09:34.400
That will be worse...

09:34.400 --> 09:38.400
I don't want to die so soon...!
Why am I so...

09:39.400 --> 09:40.400
Are you through?!

09:40.400 --> 09:44.400
I told you not to offend Ouyang Xiaotian
but you wouldn't listen!

09:44.400 --> 09:48.400
We're on tenterhooks as a result!
This kind of life isn't blissful at all

09:48.400 --> 09:52.400
They say if you're fated to
lead a good life, you will

09:52.400 --> 09:57.400
There's no point practising your skills
now. It won't make any difference

09:57.400 --> 10:00.400
I'll break your legs first then!

10:02.400 --> 10:04.000
Don't...!

10:13.000 --> 10:16.400
Go beat Ouyang Xiaotian if you have
the guts! Don't take it out on us!

10:16.400 --> 10:18.400
I'll beat him to death...!

10:18.400 --> 10:21.400
I bought that with money!
Don't waste it!

10:23.400 --> 10:26.000
What are you doing, Father?

10:27.400 --> 10:33.400
This is for convulsions, this is to
calm my mind, and this, my nerves

10:34.400 --> 10:38.400
I need to prepare myself
for your duel tomorrow

10:40.400 --> 10:44.400
Aren't you afraid you might die from
taking too much medicine?

10:44.400 --> 10:48.000
I'd rather die that way
than be scared to death by you!

10:49.000 --> 10:51.400
Don't say I didn't warn you

10:51.400 --> 10:56.400
There are no goodies in the
border areas. Think twice about it

10:56.400 --> 10:59.400
That'll mean the end of me!

11:01.400 --> 11:04.400
-What are you up to?
-Nothing

11:04.400 --> 11:07.400
-Be honest
-I am being honest

11:07.400 --> 11:10.000
Don't ever borrow money from me again

11:10.400 --> 11:13.400
-All right, I'll tell you
-Out with it

11:13.400 --> 11:17.400
We share the same anxiety.
You have a mother, so do I

11:17.400 --> 11:22.000
She isn't my real mother, but she brought
me up. I shouldn't get her into trouble

11:22.000 --> 11:25.400
That's why I'm having second thoughts
about the duel

11:25.400 --> 11:27.400
-Is that all?
-Yes

11:27.400 --> 11:29.400
-Any other worries?
-No

11:29.400 --> 11:31.400
-Look at me
-I said no

11:32.000 --> 11:33.400
-Look at me!
-I said no!

11:33.400 --> 11:35.400
What about Shuangxi?

11:39.400 --> 11:46.000
Indeed she's my worry too. A nice girl
like her is hard to come by. So...

11:49.400 --> 11:52.400
-You're right to think that way!
-I'm right?

11:52.400 --> 11:57.000
Shuangxi is such a nice girl. Giving
her up to go into exile is stupid!

11:57.000 --> 12:00.400
Precisely!
I also think you're right

12:01.200 --> 12:05.200
You can't do without good food;
you must eat. Right?

12:06.400 --> 12:08.400
-I'll die otherwise
-That's right!

12:08.400 --> 12:10.400
Both of us are right.
Who's at fault then?

12:10.400 --> 12:12.000
Lu!

12:28.400 --> 12:31.000
What? Pull out?

12:31.400 --> 12:37.200
Am I hearing things? You want to
pull out at this time?

12:38.400 --> 12:42.400
Having known you for so long,
I've finally seen through you!

12:44.400 --> 12:47.000
Don't put it that way

12:48.200 --> 12:53.200
Open your eyes wide and see, Lu

12:54.400 --> 12:59.000
We'll be frank. Given our calibre,
can we possibly win the duel?

12:59.000 --> 13:00.000
Precisely

13:00.000 --> 13:02.400
Why not get the Five Fortunes
to replace us?

13:02.400 --> 13:03.400
I agree!

13:03.400 --> 13:09.400
It's a good idea, Lu.
They're young, lively and agile

13:09.400 --> 13:15.400
Plus you, there will be six people.
You can take turns in the duel

13:15.400 --> 13:18.400
Ouyang Xiaotian will be scared
to death, if not beaten!

13:18.400 --> 13:20.400
It's the best way out!

13:20.400 --> 13:23.400
Best in what sense?!

13:24.400 --> 13:30.400
You're just thinking of leaving me
to deal with Ouyang Xiaotian alone!

13:30.400 --> 13:34.400
We really have everybody's interests
at heart

13:34.400 --> 13:39.400
Look at me!
Look at my size!

13:39.400 --> 13:44.400
I'll only take up space
on the stage

13:45.400 --> 13:49.000
Please stop finding excuses
for yourself

13:49.400 --> 13:53.400
Just look at the way things are

13:54.400 --> 14:00.000
Ouyang Xiaotian will never
allow you to get a replacement

14:00.000 --> 14:04.000
Like you said, he's a tiger
waiting to eat us up

14:04.000 --> 14:07.000
He isn't interested in
eating other people

14:07.000 --> 14:12.000
Knowing he's out to eat us up,
you still want us to fight him

14:12.000 --> 14:14.000
Some friend you are!

14:14.000 --> 14:15.400
It's meaningless!

14:15.400 --> 14:20.000
It's meaningless being friends
with you!

14:20.000 --> 14:24.000
This has nothing to do with
our friendship!

14:24.000 --> 14:31.400
Who says it doesn't?
We promised to share weal and woe!

14:31.400 --> 14:35.400
But now that there's trouble,
you want to back out!

14:36.000 --> 14:38.000
I've seen through you!

14:39.400 --> 14:43.000
-Let's talk things out
-Are we still brothers?

14:43.400 --> 14:47.400
If we take part in the duel,
we'll only cause your ruin

14:47.400 --> 14:49.400
How do you know that?

14:49.400 --> 14:53.400
Don't think that way, Brother Fuqi.
You have my support

14:55.400 --> 14:59.400
-Support to what?
-To take up the challenge

14:59.400 --> 15:03.000
-Am I up to it?
-Sure!

15:03.000 --> 15:06.400
If you think you can do it, you can.
Have confidence in yourself

15:06.400 --> 15:13.000
Miss Yu is braver than you.
You ought to be ashamed of yourself!

15:13.400 --> 15:19.200
She can talk big because
she's not taking part in the duel

15:19.400 --> 15:23.400
I'm not passing irresponsible remarks

15:23.400 --> 15:25.400
I really feel that...

15:25.400 --> 15:29.400
since Ouyang Xiaotian thinks you'll
lose, you might as well fight him out

15:29.400 --> 15:32.400
What high aspirations she has!

15:33.400 --> 15:38.200
So long as we're confident,
we'll win the duel for sure!

15:39.400 --> 15:46.400
In that case, let me ask you -
do our hearts beat as one?

15:46.400 --> 15:47.400
Yes!

15:47.400 --> 15:49.400
-Do we share the same fate?
-Yes!

15:49.400 --> 15:52.000
-Are we brothers?
-Yes!

15:52.000 --> 15:55.400
Fine, we'll fight it out
with Ouyang Xiaotian!

15:55.400 --> 15:58.400
-We'll surmount all difficulties!
-We'll do our best!

16:01.200 --> 16:03.200
This fortune bag is for you

16:03.400 --> 16:09.400
You're so good at sewing.
Thank you. I'm lost for words

16:10.400 --> 16:15.400
From now on, whenever you do a good deed,
write a "fu" (fortune) and put it inside

16:15.400 --> 16:19.400
When the bag is full, you'll be
the most fortunate man in the world

16:19.400 --> 16:21.400
Rest assured I'll do that

16:25.200 --> 16:27.200
No more fortune!

16:28.400 --> 16:30.000
All gone!

16:31.400 --> 16:32.400
Sis!

16:32.400 --> 16:36.000
Sorry I let them all out

16:36.400 --> 16:39.400
Never mind,
I can always catch some more

16:40.000 --> 16:42.000
Are you that free?

16:42.400 --> 16:48.000
Do you have anything
against fireflies? Ridiculous!

16:48.400 --> 16:51.000
You're right

16:51.400 --> 16:57.000
If you really have a lot of energy,
think of how to win the duel

16:57.400 --> 17:01.000
Don't tell me you're waiting
to be sent into exile

17:01.400 --> 17:03.400
No...

17:05.400 --> 17:08.400
You think the authorities
are joking with you?

17:08.400 --> 17:12.000
Everybody in Ping'an Town
is saying...

17:12.400 --> 17:17.200
they can't wait to be rid of
the three vermins after the duel!

17:17.200 --> 17:19.200
They look down on them, that's why!

17:19.200 --> 17:20.400
Exactly!

17:21.400 --> 17:27.000
Let me ask you. You know
you'll be sent into exile

17:27.000 --> 17:29.000
So why won't you leave Shuangxi alone?

17:29.000 --> 17:32.400
Do you want her to suffer with you
at the borders?

17:33.000 --> 17:35.400
What a thing to say, Sis!

17:36.000 --> 17:38.000
Am I not right?

17:39.400 --> 17:45.000
Wake up, the two of you!
You won't have a future together!

17:45.400 --> 17:49.200
The sun will never rise for you
even if the cock crows itself hoarse!

17:50.400 --> 17:54.400
By saying that,
you're going too far

17:55.400 --> 17:57.400
Not at all

17:58.400 --> 18:05.000
You have no money, power or luck.
How will you look after Shuangxi?

18:06.400 --> 18:13.000
I'm really grateful to you for
helping us win the case the other time

18:13.400 --> 18:18.400
But I can't entrust Shuangxi to you
because you don't have what it takes!

18:20.400 --> 18:24.200
I know I have no money, power,
luck or ability

18:24.400 --> 18:30.000
Indeed you don't.
You're practically a loser!

18:30.400 --> 18:33.400
You're too much, Sis!

18:34.400 --> 18:38.000
Never mind, Shuangxi.
She's right

18:39.400 --> 18:43.000
Don't take it to heart.
She was talking rot

18:43.400 --> 18:46.400
It's all right.
I won't take it to heart

18:47.400 --> 18:49.400
That's good

18:51.400 --> 18:54.400
I'm a straightforward person

18:54.400 --> 18:58.400
But honest advice grates on the ear

19:00.400 --> 19:02.400
I'll be going, Shuangxi

19:03.400 --> 19:10.000
I won't see you out. Take care.
Go home and think over my words

19:11.400 --> 19:16.000
Don't call on Shuangxi unnecessarily.
She can't help you in the duel

19:16.400 --> 19:17.400
Bye

19:21.400 --> 19:27.400
You think he'll kill himself? Even
the King of Hades wouldn't want him!

19:51.400 --> 19:53.400
Are you guys all right?

19:53.400 --> 19:56.400
Don't worry, Brother.
I can take it

19:57.400 --> 20:00.400
I didn't know my punches
were so strong

20:01.400 --> 20:06.000
Congratulations. That shows your skill
has reached the acme of perfection

20:06.400 --> 20:07.400
Really?

20:07.400 --> 20:10.400
Yes. We wouldn't be in such bad shape
otherwise

20:10.400 --> 20:13.400
Let's have another round then!

20:14.400 --> 20:16.400
Again?

20:16.400 --> 20:19.400
I haven't beaten all of you

20:19.400 --> 20:25.000
Unless I beat you all, it's no proof
that I've mastered Iron Fist

20:42.400 --> 20:48.000
Thanks! You helped me master
Iron Fist. I'll never forget you!

20:57.400 --> 21:02.400
Your acting is so convincing!
We can all become actors!

21:26.400 --> 21:28.400
You gave me a fright!
When did you come?

21:28.400 --> 21:30.400
You're just too timid

21:31.000 --> 21:34.400
What was that gimmick you did?
It looked interesting

21:34.400 --> 21:38.400
Excuse me, the strokes were invented
based on the movements of...

21:38.400 --> 21:42.000
tiger, deer, bear, ape and bird

21:42.000 --> 21:44.000
It was Miss Ma who taught me

21:44.200 --> 21:47.200
How come they looked weak,
like dancing to me?

21:47.400 --> 21:49.400
Indeed they're weak

21:49.400 --> 21:55.400
Miss Ma said it isn't hard boxing.
It's meant for fatsos like me

21:55.400 --> 21:59.400
It opens up my channels,
enhances my blood circulation and...

21:59.400 --> 22:01.400
gives me a clear head!

22:01.400 --> 22:04.400
But you've always been quick-witted

22:04.400 --> 22:08.000
Your only problem is that
you're a bit weak and lazy

22:09.000 --> 22:10.000
I am?

22:10.000 --> 22:14.400
Spicy woman won't let you eat, but you
still manage to get your hands on goodies

22:14.400 --> 22:16.400
That's proof of your stamina!

22:17.400 --> 22:23.000
So what? I'll be challenged in wits,
not in eating

22:23.400 --> 22:26.400
You're competing in wits,
as for martial arts...

22:26.400 --> 22:29.400
How are you progressing
in your Iron Fist training?

22:29.400 --> 22:35.000
So-so, but the Five Fortunes said
I've reached the acme of perfection

22:35.400 --> 22:37.000
That fantastic?

22:37.000 --> 22:39.400
-Shall I show you a few strokes?
-Sure!

22:39.400 --> 22:44.400
Watch out. The Five Fortunes were beaten
to a pulp by my Iron Fist, you know

22:49.400 --> 22:52.000
Do you feel the force of my fists?

22:53.400 --> 22:57.200
Your Highness, I found
a nice kite. Look

22:58.400 --> 23:05.200
What a fine painting! Why is it done
on a kite and not on paper?

23:05.200 --> 23:07.200
Isn't it a waste?

23:07.200 --> 23:12.400
What's weird is, there's a moon, but
the inscription says "waiting at noon"

23:12.400 --> 23:17.400
And the lady is so well-dressed,
yet it says here, "busy changing"

23:17.400 --> 23:19.400
Everything is the opposite

23:19.400 --> 23:23.400
"Waiting at noon"?
"Busy changing"?

23:23.400 --> 23:26.400
Is some lecher trying to
take liberties?

23:26.400 --> 23:30.200
No, don't worry.
Someone only wishes to see me

23:56.400 --> 23:59.400
Sorry to keep you waiting

23:59.400 --> 24:04.400
Why didn't you come in
by the entrance, Master Wei?

24:05.000 --> 24:07.000
Look at all that filth

24:12.400 --> 24:14.400
I'm an enemy of the Marquis

24:14.400 --> 24:18.400
Had I tried to come in by the door,
I'd have been barred from entering

24:18.400 --> 24:22.400
Besides, aren't you
being confined by him?

24:23.000 --> 24:26.400
I'm fine.
Stop worrying about me

24:26.400 --> 24:30.000
Why do you want to see me
at such a late hour?

24:30.400 --> 24:36.400
I just want to let you know that
I'm confident of winning the duel

24:36.400 --> 24:40.000
Rest assured I'll get you out

24:40.400 --> 24:44.000
I just told you not to worry about me

24:45.000 --> 24:49.400
It's the safety of you, your buddies
and your families that matters

24:49.400 --> 24:54.400
No, Your Highness. I'm willing to
brave all dangers for you

24:54.400 --> 24:58.400
Nothing is more important than freeing
you from the clutches of the Marquis

24:58.400 --> 25:01.000
You're really good to me

25:01.400 --> 25:08.400
Nobody else treats me better,
except my father and the Marquis

25:08.400 --> 25:10.000
Ouyang Xiaotian?

25:11.400 --> 25:16.400
He confines you and tries to make you
marry him. And you still say he's good?

25:17.400 --> 25:19.400
I mean...

25:20.400 --> 25:24.400
I mean, his father dotes on me a lot

25:25.400 --> 25:29.400
He's unlike Ouyang Xiaotian,
who's conceited, self-opinionated,

25:29.400 --> 25:34.000
never humours me,
and is always antagonizing me

25:34.400 --> 25:38.200
Don't worry.
I'll never let you marry him

25:38.400 --> 25:44.000
The important thing now is to win the
duel so your families will be all right

25:44.400 --> 25:50.200
After all, I started everything.
I'll feel bad if you're sent into exile

25:50.400 --> 25:53.000
Don't worry about that

25:53.000 --> 25:57.000
I'm quite sure I'll win
in the literature segment tomorrow

25:57.400 --> 26:02.400
Maybe Fu or Shou will win too

26:02.400 --> 26:05.400
Surely the three of us
aren't that lousy?

26:05.400 --> 26:09.000
I'm glad.
I'll get you into trouble otherwise

26:09.400 --> 26:14.400
Get us into trouble?
What do you mean?

26:14.400 --> 26:19.000
Well, I'll feel bad if innocent people
are implicated because of me

26:19.400 --> 26:23.400
Your Highness,
you're really kindhearted!

26:55.000 --> 26:59.400
Silence, please!
The duel will now begin!

27:00.000 --> 27:02.000
There are three rounds

27:02.400 --> 27:07.000
The first round is literature, the
second, martial arts and the third, wits

27:07.000 --> 27:12.400
We've invited Reverend Yichan from
the City God Temple to be the judge

27:12.400 --> 27:15.400
I'm sure nobody has any objection

27:19.200 --> 27:22.200
Don't be nervous, Your Highness.
You've torn the handkerchief

27:23.400 --> 27:27.000
This is linked to three families'
fate. How can I remain calm?

27:27.400 --> 27:32.400
It's all because I shot my mouth off
that this happens

27:32.400 --> 27:35.400
There's no point
reproaching yourself now

27:36.400 --> 27:43.400
The first round - literature.
It's the Marquis versus Wei Delu

27:50.400 --> 27:51.400
Do your best!

27:59.400 --> 28:05.800
Once you're on the stage, you're not
to get off or you'll be disqualified

28:31.400 --> 28:35.400
You'll be tested on your
literary talent in this round

28:35.400 --> 28:40.400
The first part is riddles

28:40.400 --> 28:46.400
One will set a riddle and the other
will have to guess the character

28:47.400 --> 28:52.000
If you can't think of a riddle
or can't guess the answer,

28:52.000 --> 28:54.000
points will be deducted from you

28:56.000 --> 29:00.400
What's all that "neither" for?
What rubbish is it?

29:00.400 --> 29:03.400
That's the riddle he's set

29:03.400 --> 29:07.400
Lu must guess the right answer
or he'll lose one point

29:09.400 --> 29:13.400
What is it that's like a fox, a cat
and a dog but is not an animal?

29:13.400 --> 29:16.400
What monster is it?

29:16.400 --> 29:21.400
If my guess is right, the first and
second parts of the riddle tell you...

29:21.400 --> 29:24.400
what the character is made up of

29:24.400 --> 29:29.200
The third part tells you that
the answer isn't an animal

29:29.200 --> 29:30.400
What is it?

29:30.400 --> 29:35.400
It's so simple. Lu should have
no problem getting the answer right

29:46.400 --> 29:50.000
Neither black, white, red nor yellow

29:50.000 --> 29:53.400
That leaves only blue

29:56.400 --> 30:01.000
Like a fox, a cat and a dog.
Neither a fowl nor a beast

30:01.400 --> 30:04.400
The last line is quite tricky

30:05.400 --> 30:12.000
"Quan" forms part of the characters
of foxes, cats and dogs

30:12.000 --> 30:17.400
I put it next to "blue". Together
it forms the character "guess"

30:25.400 --> 30:28.400
Am I right, Your Excellency?

30:42.400 --> 30:45.000
I have butterflies in my stomach.
I need to...

30:45.400 --> 30:47.400
Why are you so tensed up?

30:47.400 --> 30:49.400
I need to go to the latrine

30:49.400 --> 30:52.400
Just hold out!
Hold out!

30:53.400 --> 30:56.200
-Just hold out!
-No...

31:08.400 --> 31:11.400
Why are riddles so ambiguous?

31:12.400 --> 31:18.000
The one the Marquis set was full of
"neithers". Lu's is just the opposite

31:18.000 --> 31:22.000
If it's so easy to guess,
it won't be a riddle anymore, fool

31:23.200 --> 31:24.400
I mean, hunk

31:32.400 --> 31:37.400
Since it's found in poems and
The Analects of Confucius, it's "yan"

31:39.400 --> 31:44.000
Not know the directions.
That means losing one's way ("mi lu")

31:44.200 --> 31:50.000
A "yan" plus a "mi" make
the character "mi" as in riddles

31:53.400 --> 31:59.400
Both of you are on a par
with each other in literary talents

31:59.400 --> 32:03.200
This competition
is an eye-opener to us

32:04.400 --> 32:09.000
I must say you're both talents

32:09.400 --> 32:14.000
You have literary grace,
and you, a flair for writing

32:14.400 --> 32:18.400
But since this is a competition,
there has to be a winner

32:19.400 --> 32:23.400
Now, I'll give you
the first half of a couplet

32:23.400 --> 32:26.400
You'll have to complete it

32:26.400 --> 32:29.200
But there's a rule

32:29.400 --> 32:37.000
Your couplets must pay compliments
to each other to ensure no quarrels

32:38.400 --> 32:43.400
The theme of the first half
of the couplet is Ping'an Town

32:44.400 --> 32:46.400
Here it goes

32:46.400 --> 32:52.400
Four seasons of blossoms
and prosperity every year

32:54.280 --> 32:55.280
Gentlemen

33:11.400 --> 33:15.000
Let's have a look
at the Marquis' first

33:15.400 --> 33:21.000
Ten years of studies
and poems every day

33:22.400 --> 33:23.400
Not bad

33:27.200 --> 33:30.200
Let's have a look at Master Wei's

33:30.400 --> 33:35.400
A family of loyal officials
and honour every generation

33:36.400 --> 33:37.400
Good!

33:38.400 --> 33:40.400
I don't understand

33:40.400 --> 33:45.400
Though I'm not well-educated, I often
hear people saying "xinyi lianchi"

33:46.000 --> 33:49.000
Why did Lu miss out "chi"?

33:49.400 --> 33:51.400
You should know him

33:51.400 --> 33:55.400
He's actually mocking Ouyang Xiaotian
by saying he's shameless (no "chi")

33:57.400 --> 34:04.000
Shameless!
Shameless...!

34:09.400 --> 34:11.400
-Not so loud!
-But he is shameless!

34:11.400 --> 34:14.400
You might affect
the result of the competition

34:18.000 --> 34:22.000
The second half Master Wei has written
goes better with...

34:22.000 --> 34:24.000
the first half of the couplet

34:24.400 --> 34:31.000
But it compliments the Marquis
on the surface and mock him on the sly

34:32.400 --> 34:36.400
It does not conform with my emphasis
on a harmonious relationship

34:37.400 --> 34:42.000
So the Marquis is the winner
for this round

35:14.400 --> 35:19.400
There are rules in writing couplets,
and in competitions too

35:19.400 --> 35:25.000
I'm just abiding by the rules set down.
Please don't put me in a spot

35:43.400 --> 35:47.000
I've let Your Highness down

35:49.000 --> 35:55.000
Please don't say that. I feel bad
to have got your family implicated

35:56.400 --> 36:03.000
I was too careless to have given him
an advantage over myself

36:06.400 --> 36:11.000
It's all right. For all you know,
you might win in the next two rounds

36:11.000 --> 36:14.400
We were most confident of this round,
but now...

36:18.400 --> 36:21.000
I'm sorry.
Please excuse me

36:23.000 --> 36:26.400
-It's your fault!
-No, it's your fault!

36:26.400 --> 36:28.200
Your fault!

36:29.400 --> 36:33.400
What now? We lost the first round,
and the most confident one at that

36:33.400 --> 36:38.400
It's your fault for revealing
Lu's intention in writing the couplet

36:38.400 --> 36:42.000
Had you not asked me,
would I have said it?

36:42.400 --> 36:46.200
I was talking to myself.
You could've kept quiet

36:46.400 --> 36:49.400
Yeah, yeah, you were
talking to yourself

36:49.400 --> 36:54.400
Had you not announced it, would
everyone else and the monk have heard it?

36:54.400 --> 36:57.000
What have you got to say now?

36:58.000 --> 37:00.000
Lu, is it his fault?

37:00.400 --> 37:04.400
Your Excellency, do be magnanimous
and forgive them

37:04.400 --> 37:09.000
I'll take Lu in hand. Rest assured
he won't antagonize you again

37:09.000 --> 37:13.000
Please let us off.
Don't send us into exile

37:13.400 --> 37:17.400
Can you call off the duel? My son
doesn't want to take part anymore

37:18.400 --> 37:22.000
Please let us off!
We've realized our mistakes

37:22.400 --> 37:29.000
Take it out on the Weis if you must.
They lost the first round anyway

37:29.400 --> 37:33.000
How could you suggest that!
You have no loyalty at all!

37:33.400 --> 37:38.000
Even a married couple may part in time
of disaster. We aren't even neighbours!

37:38.400 --> 37:42.000
It's all my fault. There's no point
blaming each other now

37:43.000 --> 37:48.000
We may have lost the first round,
but we still have two more chances

37:49.400 --> 37:53.400
I thought I was just a spare.
I wasn't prepared to go on stage

37:53.400 --> 37:56.000
That's why you two must win

37:56.400 --> 38:01.000
I only know how to eat.
I'm not cut out for duels!

38:01.400 --> 38:05.400
Listen, Shou. Fu should be able to
win in the second round

38:05.400 --> 38:07.400
It'll be a draw then

38:07.400 --> 38:12.000
As for the third round,
we're counting on you

38:14.400 --> 38:17.400
But I'm really not up to it...

38:17.400 --> 38:20.200
We're counting on you!

38:21.400 --> 38:25.000
Aren't you resourceful
every time you try to sneak a bite?

38:25.000 --> 38:28.000
-Have some confidence in yourself
-You can do it!

38:28.000 --> 38:34.000
My son has misbehaved, Your Excellency.
I'm sorry! Please let him off!

38:36.400 --> 38:42.400
Your sons insisted on the duel.
There's nothing I can do

38:43.400 --> 38:49.000
Since they agreed to the duel, they
should be prepared for the consequences

38:49.400 --> 38:55.400
Your sons think too highly of themselves.
His Excellency is teaching them a lesson

38:55.400 --> 38:59.400
They'll be less conceited and know
how to conduct themselves in future

39:00.400 --> 39:03.400
Yes, you're right.
But the duel...

39:03.400 --> 39:05.000
We'll see

39:05.000 --> 39:08.000
Please have a break over there,
Your Excellency

39:10.400 --> 39:12.200
It's Mother!

39:15.000 --> 39:17.000
What a disgrace!
Come over!

39:17.400 --> 39:23.400
Were you begging Ouyang Xiaotian
to let me off, Mother? Oh please!

39:24.400 --> 39:28.400
Forget about the duel, Shou.
Let's go home

39:28.400 --> 39:32.200
I'll cook your favourite dishes
for you!

39:32.400 --> 39:35.000
Let's go before things get worse!

39:35.400 --> 39:38.400
There are two more rounds, Father

39:38.400 --> 39:45.000
You were the most eligible contestant
but even you have lost!

39:46.400 --> 39:51.400
Let's just go home and pack
some belongings and run away!

39:51.400 --> 39:53.400
How could we do that, Father?

39:54.400 --> 39:57.400
It beats being sent to the borders

39:58.400 --> 40:01.400
What about Fu and Shou then?

40:01.400 --> 40:04.200
Relax, they still have me!

40:04.400 --> 40:07.400
Come on, I know you too well

40:07.400 --> 40:12.400
And there's that invalid. You really
think you can turn the tables?

40:13.400 --> 40:18.000
We have to give it a shot. If we
don't try, we won't even have a chance!

40:18.000 --> 40:22.400
How well you put it.
You're always getting me into trouble

40:22.400 --> 40:26.000
Says who? Didn't I settle
Shuangxi's case myself?

40:26.000 --> 40:27.000
Shuangxi?

40:27.400 --> 40:31.000
Where is she?
How come I don't see her?

40:31.400 --> 40:34.400
I'm not her.
How would I know?

40:34.400 --> 40:37.400
If I were her, I wouldn't come
and get myself into trouble

40:38.400 --> 40:43.400
No, Mother. If I leave now,
Fu and Lu will hate me for life

40:44.000 --> 40:49.000
It beats being sent to the borders
and starved to death!

40:49.000 --> 40:54.400
I have to keep my word.
There's no alternative for me now

40:55.400 --> 40:59.400
I guess I don't mean as much
to you as your buddies?

41:00.400 --> 41:04.400
You mean as much to me
as my buddies do, Father

41:04.400 --> 41:09.400
Only by winning the duel can everyone
be saved. We're all in the same boat

41:11.000 --> 41:13.000
There's no turning back!

41:14.400 --> 41:17.400
She'll come for sure
because she isn't you

41:19.400 --> 41:21.400
Fuqi-ge!

41:22.400 --> 41:24.400
I knew you'd come!

41:24.400 --> 41:27.400
I went to the market with my sis
so I was late

41:27.400 --> 41:28.400
It's all right

41:28.400 --> 41:30.400
Is the first round over?
What was the result?

41:30.400 --> 41:32.400
We lost

41:34.400 --> 41:37.000
Never mind, there are two more rounds.
Work harder!

41:37.000 --> 41:39.000
Rest assured I'll do my best!

41:42.400 --> 41:44.400
You'd better win

41:46.000 --> 41:49.400
Have confidence in me, will you?
Some mother you are!

41:50.000 --> 41:52.000
You can do it, I'm sure!

41:54.000 --> 41:58.000
It's windy here, Your Highness.
Do you need to put on more clothing?

41:58.400 --> 42:01.000
I've done that.
Thanks

42:01.400 --> 42:08.000
You saw what happened in the
first round. It was redundant

42:08.000 --> 42:12.000
You've only won one round
and it's gone to your head?

42:12.000 --> 42:16.400
Do you think they can win
in the next two rounds?

42:16.400 --> 42:18.400
Well, if they put in enough effort

42:24.400 --> 42:28.000
Give your best!

42:45.400 --> 42:48.000
The second round is a contest of wits!

42:49.400 --> 42:51.400
Outrageous!

42:52.400 --> 42:57.200
Wasn't this round
supposed to be martial arts?

42:57.400 --> 43:00.400
Who told you that?
You must've made a mistake

43:00.400 --> 43:04.000
You announced it just now.
It's also written on the...

43:08.400 --> 43:13.200
You secretly changed the order.
I'll beat you to a pulp!

43:13.400 --> 43:18.000
If you're so hotheaded, how will you
contend with your opponent in wits?

43:18.400 --> 43:21.400
I'm not doing that.
I'll get Mei Shouquan up here

43:23.400 --> 43:28.400
If you get off the stage, you'll be
disqualified. It's the rule

43:29.400 --> 43:33.400
They actually changed the order
to catch us on the hop!

43:33.400 --> 43:36.400
Aren't they cheap and despicable!

43:36.400 --> 43:41.000
If Fu contends with them in wits,
he'll lose for sure!

43:41.000 --> 43:43.000
He has no wits to speak of!

43:43.400 --> 43:47.400
Oh no! If he wins this round,
I'll have to go up and...

43:47.400 --> 43:49.400
take my opponent on in martial arts!

43:50.400 --> 43:53.000
I'm passing out...

43:53.000 --> 43:55.000
Why have you passed out, Shou?

43:55.400 --> 43:57.400
Subtitled by S Lin
